，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100},{"id":"mingdi-q-o033","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-09dfeca953080b644d0d","layer":"original","quote":"比诏书到〖15〗，轨已进军屯阴馆〖16〗。遣将军苏尚、董弼追鲜卑。比能遣子将千余骑，迎步度根部落。与尚、弼相遇，战于楼烦〖17〗；二将没。步度根部落皆叛出塞，与比能合，寇边。遣骁骑将军秦朗将中军讨之〖18〗。虏乃走漠北。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118},{"id":"wuhuan-q-0364b595e9ceeba2c64c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"比能遣子将骑与尚等会战于楼烦〖27〗，临阵害尚、弼","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":54,"end":79},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4b216514364195ceb362","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4c5e8382612afb0fefda","layer":"original","quote":"并州刺史毕轨遣将军苏尚、董弼等击之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":36,"end":53},{"id":"wuhuan-q-604235d65ce57b8377c3","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-6c30f7f2ead157650caf","layer":"original","quote":"毕轨有陉北之败","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":83},{"id":"wuhuan-q-cfb1d29c968d96de0767","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-faa0eac8be27a9cd175d","layer":"original","quote":"帝遣骁骑将军秦朗征之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":81}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
